# Your sessions and your scores. Excluded by default so that cloning or forking
# this framework never publishes anyone's learning data.
#
# Want your own history versioned? Keep it in a PRIVATE fork and delete these
# two lines. Note that git history is permanent — anything committed survives a
# later `git rm`, so decide before the first commit, not after.
learn/
log/

# Installation-specific overrides the skill reads from the run directory (see
# skills/teach/STORAGE.md). Root-anchored so the template copy stays tracked.
/teach-config.md

# Local Claude Code state (install.sh writes symlinks into ~/.claude, not here)
.claude/

# Obsidian's own state, if this directory is ever opened as a vault
.obsidian/
.trash/

# Machine-local noise and secrets
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.local.*
*.orig
*.rej
*~
.*.sw?
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
